{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Game Introduction]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A story-driven horror visual novel created with RPG Maker 2003.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Synopsis]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I happened to run into my little sister's friend. Although she always appeared cheerful, a distinct bruise marred her body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Just forget it.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Those words keep echoing in my mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Game Features]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story-Driven Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a dark, emotional narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Suspense</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a gripping, suspenseful atmosphere as you unravel the secrets lurking beneath the surface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Retro RPG Maker 2003 Charm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the classic feel of a traditional RPG Maker horror game.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3602740?t=1744882267","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3602740?t=1744882267","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602740/2f32eec03c4be2dd251feed59d4aaaff6204572e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744882267","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602740/2f32eec03c4be2dd251feed59d4aaaff6204572e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744882267","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Violence, Blood, Underwear Exposure"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Game Introduction]</strong></p><p 